{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Number Machine is an open-ended factory and automation game with math mechanics. Design, build, and optimize factories that automatically assemble and deliver complex numerical structures. Inspired by Opus Magnum and Infinifactory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Build fully autonomous factories on a hexagonal grid using specialized machines. Move, combine, split, destroy, and modify numbered orbs with math to form the required structures with specific shapes and values.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use conveyors, pushers, lasers, magnetism, rotators, and much more to create an efficient system. Optimize for size and speed to climb the leaderboards... but be wary: one small oversight and your entire design can fail<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game features a unique cel-shaded art style that gives it a colorful, clean, and stylized look. All animations are seamless, with a single continuous camera movement from start to finish to keep you fully immersed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2231090?t=1751811521","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2231090?t=1751811521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/af2de848875bd5df20280656274dbc77db2a7f44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751811521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/af2de848875bd5df20280656274dbc77db2a7f44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751811521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Number Machine is an open-ended factory and automation game with math mechanics. Design, build, and optimize factories that automatically assemble and deliver complex numerical structures. Inspired by Opus Magnum and Infinifactory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Build fully autonomous factories on a hexagonal grid using specialized machines. Move, combine, split, destroy, and modify numbered orbs with math to form the required structures with specific shapes and values.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use conveyors, pushers, lasers, magnetism, rotators, and much more to create an efficient system. Optimize for size and speed to climb the leaderboards... but be wary: one small oversight and your entire design can fail<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.poster.avif?t=1751811521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.webm?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.mp4?t=1751811521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game features a unique cel-shaded art style that gives it a colorful, clean, and stylized look. All animations are seamless, with a single continuous camera movement from start to finish to keep you fully immersed.</p>","developers":["ARIELEK"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/b0031a